OL,3,GNEWSAA14 closed near Cambridge
OL,4,Afollowing serious crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A14 near Cambridge has been closed
OL,7,Feastbound following a serious
OL,8,Fcollision.
OL,10,FNational Highways said it was shut
OL,11,Fbetween junction 31, the Girton
OL,12,FInterchange for the M11 and the A1307,
OL,13,Fand junction 33 at Milton.
OL,15,FThe crash happened at about 13:40 BST,
OL,16,Fand Cambridgeshire Police are at the
OL,17,Fscene leading the response.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
